  "f2_upgrade_assessment": {
    "outcome": "remain_F1",
    "reason": "The official dynamic-characteristics table publishes propagation delays only at CL = 50 pF. archetype-logic74hc requires both 15 pF and 50 pF rows to separate intrinsic delay from load-dependent delay and asserts both rows within 15 percent. With only one load point, TAU can support nominal function but cannot earn the DC/transient F2 ceiling.",
